<title>GERMANY: Hesse says Nov CPI unchanged, up 1.3 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>Hesse says Nov CPI unchanged, up 1.3 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics office of the German state of Hesse said on Monday that November consumer prices were steady on the previous month and up 1.3 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>In October, the monthly figure was unchanged on the previous month and prices year-on-year were up 1.3 percent.</p>
<p>The data from four German states, including Hesse, are used to calculate preliminary inflation.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
